1521158.steps:
1. Policy \ Rules and Policies \ DNS Rules, add top: a policy named Test, Interface-X0, action-Filter, Enable;
2. From multiple clients in X0, send DNS traffic through the DUT;
3. Policy \ DNS Security \ Reports \ Domain tab, select All Domains and All Categories, check the page;
4. Repeat step2, click Refresh icon;
5. To Host tab, repeat step 4;
6. To Statistic tab, repeat step 4.

1521169.steps:
1. Policy \ Rules and Policies \ DNS Rules, add top: a policy named Test, Interface-X0, action-Filter, Enable;
2. From X0, send DNS traffic through the DUT;
3. Policy \ DNS Security \ Reports \ Database tab, click Export Database button.

1521170.steps:
1. Policy \ Rules and Policies \ DNS Rules, add top: a policy named Test, Interface-X0, action-Filter, Enable;
2. From X0, send DNS traffic through the DUT;
3. From CLI, enter configure mode;
4. Input:<br /># export dns-filter-db csv ftp ftp://user:password@servername/dns-filter-db.csv <br /># export dns-filter-db csv user@server:/home/user/dns-filter-db.csv <br /># export dns-filter-db csv scp user@server:/home/user/

1521171.steps:
1. Policy \ Rules and Policies \ DNS Rules, add top: a policy named Test, Interface-X0, action-Filter, Enable;
2. Device \ Log \ Settings, set Logging level to debug, click edit, set Display Events in Log Monitor to 0 seconds, accept;
3. From X0, send DNS traffic through the DUT (over Memory Storage Size);
4. Policy \ DNS Security \ Reports \ Database tab, check External Storage Status;
5. Monitor \ System Logs, check the logs.

1521172.steps:
1. Policy \ DNS Security \ Reports, make sure some data in Memory storage;
2. Reboot the DUT;
3. Check the Database in Domain and Host page.

2045124.steps:
1.Device \ Log \ Settings, set Logging level to Inform, click edit, set Display Events in Log Monitor to 0 seconds, accept;
2.Device \ Log \ Settings \Network \ DNS Security, enable all the DNS Filtering entries, accept;
3.Rules and Policies \ DNS Rules, enable a DNS Policy : Name-Test, Action-Filter, Profile-Default Profile, Interface-X0;
4.PC connected to X0, set dns server as X0 IP, do dig adultswim.com;
5.Check System logs.
